.TH LIBTLS_TLS_INSTANCE_DEBUG 3 "2023-04-01" "libtls" "TLS Library"
.SH NAME
tls_instance_debug - Debug TLS instance
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <libtls.h>
.sp
.B void
.B tls_instance_debug(tls_instance_t* i);
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B tls_instance_debug
function prints debugging information about a TLS instance.
The
.B i
argument is a pointer to the TLS instance.
The function does not return a value.
.SH EXAMPLE
The following example demonstrates how to use the
.B tls_instance_debug
function to print debugging information about a TLS instance:
.nf
.B #include <libtls.h>
.B #include <stdio.h>
.sp
.B int main() {
.B   tls_t* tls = ...; // Assume a valid TLS instance
.B   tls_instance_debug(tls);
.B   return 0;
.B }
.ne
.fi
